quotes:
re-publishing the same `estimate_id + estimate_version` with identical
  content is answered with a fresh import result of outcome idempotent
  replay that names the existing snapshot, which stays unchanged (R0-25);
  different content for the
  same identity is rejected as an integrity conflict (content fingerprint
  recorded);

- **Archived projects.** Reads of an archived project succeed; every mutation
  of its records and every new grant or assignment for it is refused;
  revocation of existing access does not consult the Registry (R0-24).

- **Rules:** at most one active grant per `(viewer_id, project_id)`;
  revoking one grant affects only that project; Registry archival never
  changes grant status.
